Commands etc:
The script we just ran for the test is the one located at scripts/ucb_new.py, which we created earlier.

Here's the exact test command you can copy/paste into your terminal if you want to run it again yourself:

cd /home/sathyakumarnandakumar/URB
source urbenv/bin/activate
export SUMO_HOME=/home/sathyakumarnandakumar/URB/urbenv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/sumo

python scripts/ucb_new.py \
  --id ucb_test \
  --alg-conf test \
  --env-conf config1 \
  --task-conf test \
  --net ingolstadt_custom \
  --env-seed 42


